   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is part of a larger World Bank project called Natural Resources Management and Poverty Reduction Project. The overall objective s to improve rural development, to alleviate poverty, to conserve biodiversity and to ensure sustainable forest management by assisting the Armeninan Government in developing the institutional, legal and policy framework of the Armenian forestry.</narrative>
